> Sandbox creativity and structured puzzle pressure, side by side — play at your own pace.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw and paint directly in 3D space, then unleash your creations into a full physics sandbox. Build, break, and play however you like — the fun is yours to define.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sketch a sword out of thin air. Sculpt a bridge, scale it, spin it, drop it — then watch physics take over as it crashes, bounces, or holds together exactly the way you built it. Paint a portrait on canvas and hang it in the world for others to see. This is a space with no rules but the ones you draw yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But somewhere in this world, a gallery is waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you'll come across the role of <strong>keeper</strong> — a quiet job maintaining a collection of paintings, each one hiding a fragment of a story you'll only ever <i>feel</i>, never read. Place them correctly, and the world around you responds: a new light turns on, a sound resolves, a room feels a little less empty. Fail to keep up, and the pressure creeps in — timers, ciphers, grids, rotating keys — the gallery job gets harder even as your own creations get wilder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842190/extras/9b38d6bf3836013b2ff594ca30b7b2df.poster.avif?t=1787828963\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842190/extras/9b38d6bf3836013b2ff594ca30b7b2df.webm?t=1787828963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842190/extras/9b38d6bf3836013b2ff594ca30b7b2df.mp4?t=1787828963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop plays